    <title>葡萄牙语-名词</title>
    <link href="http://example.com/2025/06/28/%E8%91%A1%E8%90%84%E7%89%99%E8%AF%AD%E5%90%8D%E8%AF%8D/"/>
    <id>http://example.com/2025/06/28/%E8%91%A1%E8%90%84%E7%89%99%E8%AF%AD%E5%90%8D%E8%AF%8D/</id>
    <published>2025-06-28T13:30:10.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-07-08T14:47:59.155Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://booosiecon.github.io/"><img src="/images/Brazil1.png" alt="葡萄牙语-名词"></a> #点击图片跳转到主页面</p><p>ó ô á ã é ê</p><h1 id="日常用品"><a href="#日常用品" class="headerlink" title="日常用品"></a>日常用品</h1><p>o relógio → watch<br>a luva → glove<br>o terno → suit<br>a bota<br>fantasia → costume<br>chapéu → hat<br>bota → put on<br>tira → take off<br>calca → wear, put on<br>veste → wear<br>compra → buy<br>uso&#x2F;usa → wear<br>o vestido&#x2F;vestidos → dress&#x2F;dresses<br>casaco → coat<br>o cinto → belt<br>roupa → clothes<br>o sapato → shoe<br>a meia → sock<br>a capa → cape 披肩<br>a sandália → sandal<br>a camisa → shirt<br>agasalhos → jackets<br>a carteira → wallet &#x2F;ɒ&#x2F;<br>a saia → skirt<br>a blusas → blouses 女宽松上衣<br>a calca → tousers<br>bolsa → bag<br>bolso → pocket<br>cardápio → menu</p><p>brinquedo → toy<br>sala → room<br>mesa → chair&#x2F;subject<br>cadeira → table<br>móvel-móveis furniture<br>janela → window<br>apartamento<br>cama → bed<br>porta → door<br>portão → gate<br>parede → wall<br>cortina → curtain</p><h1 id="数字"><a href="#数字" class="headerlink" title="数字"></a>数字</h1><p>um<br>dois&#x2F;duas<br>três<br>quatro<br>cinco<br>seis<br>sete<br>oito<br>nove<br>dez</p><p>onze<br>doze<br>treze<br>quatorze<br>quinze<br>dezesseis<br>dezessete<br>dezoito<br>dezenove<br>vinte</p><h1 id="颜色"><a href="#颜色" class="headerlink" title="颜色"></a>颜色</h1><p>moreno<br>vermelhos<br>amarelo</p><h1 id="关系"><a href="#关系" class="headerlink" title="关系"></a>关系</h1><p>pelo-pela-pelos-pelas<br>mamae - mae<br>papai - pai<br>filha - filho child<br>irma - irmao sister&#x2F;brother<br>tia - tio aunt, auntie&#x2F;uncle<br>neta - neto grandchild<br>prima - primo cousin<br>sobrinha&#x2F;sobrinho niece&#x2F;nephew<br>a avó - o avô grandmother&#x2F;grandfather<br>esposa - esposo, marido wife&#x2F;husband</p>]]></content>
    
    
